            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A bulked continuous filament (BCF) yarn comprising a plurality of filaments, each filament having an average denier along its length, the plurality of filaments comprising a first group of a plurality of filaments having a first average denier per filament, and a second group of a plurality of filaments having a second average denier per filament, the first average denier per filament and the second average denier per filament being different; wherein the first average denier per filament is at least 1.5 times larger than the second average denier per filament.</p>
